        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FPH10, 1\" Diameter Flag Pole Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this flag pole holder is for use with a 1\" outside diameter pole. Mounted one to your wall with the matching finish screws. It is available in an aray decorative finishes. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware. Manufactured by <a href=\"/collections/deltana\">Deltana</a>, the nation'\u0019s most complete provider for all your home hardware needs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-FPH10-size.gif?v=1704354506\" width=\"322\" height=\"252\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FPH10 Pole Holder Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Smaller <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-3-4-inch-flag-pole-holder-deltana-fph75\"><b>3/4\" Flag Pole Bracket</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FPH10 Pole Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pole Hole Diameter: 1\" Round</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FPH10.pdf?v=1704262258\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FPH10 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
